WEBVTT

00:01:27.863 --> 00:01:31.942
gave me a totally new perspective
on my own childhood,

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:36.466
and it brought back
my memories of early life in China.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.617
For the past three decades,

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:44.363
everyone in my family had to apply
for a permission from the government

00:01:44.387 --> 00:01:45.537
to have a child.

00:01:46.369 --> 00:01:47.718
And I wondered

00:01:47.742 --> 00:01:51.938
what it was like for people
who lived under the one-child policy.

00:01:52.361 --> 00:01:55.361
So I decided to make
a documentary about it.

00:01:56.964 --> 00:01:58.869
One of the people I interviewed

00:01:58.893 --> 00:02:04.051
was the midwife who delivered
all of the babies born in my village,